 "comment": "Remote Access endpoint syntax shared by Swift and Kotlin. `validate` = RemoteEndpointValidation.validate(host:port:) (host comes back as typed). `pairingEndpoint` = RemotePairingEndpoint.make(host:port:) (empty port = 9004, brackets removed). Both are run by MacTests/RemoteEndpointVectorTests.swift and core RemoteEndpointTest.kt. `address` is the Android Address field (one string); it is split and then judged by the same rules, and only Kotlin runs it.",
